# A Sentry's Peril (sandoria 0): the items lost and the var's other values (accepted by GM with nothing held). Glenne
# without the ointment: 644 (finish: the ointment again). TradedAaveleon 2 and -1 by GM (the == 0 and == 1 tests' other
# sides): neither accepted section matches (Glenne: no handler, no default: nothing; Aaveleon: his default 101).
# TradedAaveleon 1 by GM without the case: Aaveleon's 126 (Ointment Case); option 0 and option 2: nothing; option 1:
# the case, which completes the quest at Glenne. Then TradedAaveleon 1 by GM once completed and while available (GM),
# with no case: section 3 does not answer (Aaveleon: AAVELEON_HEALED once completed, 101 while available, where
# section 3 would play 126).
lists SouthernSanDoria/Glenne/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/Glenne/onTrade SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/644 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/513 WestRonfaure/Aaveleon/onTrigger WestRonfaure/onEventFinish/126
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=-123.4,-2.0,14.5 job=WAR lvl=30
quest Sandoria.ASentrysPeril accepted
item BoneChip
login
trigger Glenne                            # TradedAaveleon 0, no ointment: 644
finish                                    # the Dose of Ointment
charvar Quest[0][0]TradedAaveleon 2
trigger Glenne                            # TradedAaveleon 2: no section; nothing
finish-if-event
trade Glenne BoneChip x1                  # TradedAaveleon 2: no section; nothing
charvar Quest[0][0]TradedAaveleon -1
trigger Glenne                            # TradedAaveleon -1: no section; nothing
finish-if-event
charvar Quest[0][0]TradedAaveleon 1
warp -431.8,-45.9,342.3 WestRonfaure
trigger Aaveleon                          # TradedAaveleon 1, no case: 126 (Ointment Case)
finish option=0                           # not option 1: nothing
trigger Aaveleon                          # 126
finish option=2                           # not option 1: nothing
trigger Aaveleon                          # 126
finish option=1                           # the Ointment Case
charvar Quest[0][0]TradedAaveleon 2
trigger Aaveleon                          # TradedAaveleon 2: no section; his default 101
finish
charvar Quest[0][0]TradedAaveleon -1
trigger Aaveleon                          # TradedAaveleon -1: no section; his default 101
finish
charvar Quest[0][0]TradedAaveleon 1
warp -123.4,-2.0,14.5 SouthernSanDoria
trade Glenne OintmentCase x1              # exactly the case: 513
finish                                    # completed; the case taken
charvar Quest[0][0]TradedAaveleon 1
warp -431.8,-45.9,342.3 WestRonfaure
trigger Aaveleon                          # completed, TradedAaveleon 1, no case: AAVELEON_HEALED (section 4)
quest Sandoria.ASentrysPeril available
charvar Quest[0][0]TradedAaveleon 1
trigger Aaveleon                          # available, TradedAaveleon 1, no case: no section; his default 101
finish
